on:**  \nMaterial-wise, white is lost unless black blunders. Best is to create some activity.  \nR: b1-b6 attacks nothing immediately but gets rook into game, avoids traps.  \n\nFinal choice: **R: b1-b6**.  \n\n---\n\n**Evaluation:** Material disadvantage, king safety okay for now, need rook activity.  \n**Reason:** P: g2-g3 is defensive but passive. R: b1-b6 develops rook to a flexible square (6th rank) without immediate risk, preparing possible future threats.  \n\n**Answer:** R: b1-b6'}
